// Ch8 B04, the end of the headland path (act1_ch08.md §2 B04; F02). At Coilspire's door the spire's
// Tender looks at Liss's bare right arm, then at Toma's papers, and lets her in, tight-lipped. The
// custom that let Liss go in Ch6 is now a rule at a temple door (pillar 2: the faith's mercy has a
// shape). Music: corrow_day has thinned to wind; coilspire_flues comes up as the door opens. The chapter
// flow sets ch08_entered_coilspire and puts the party inside at the hearth's tier.
title: ch08_spire_door
location: ch08/coilspire
---
@camera F02_door
@music coilspire_flues fade=3.0
@anim tender look_at liss
@wait 1.2
@anim tender look_at toma
@anim toma present_papers
@wait 1.0
Tender [cold]: The Lady Cantor's guardians may attend her. #line:ch08_spire_door_001
@sfx spire_door
@mark asha door_asha walk
@mark liss door_liss walk
@wait 0.8
===
